DSH-Mobile Licensing
====================

DSH-Mobile is a multi-component project. The project's own code is released
under the MIT License below; vendored components carry their own licenses
and are documented in this file.

| Component | License | Location |
|-----------|---------|----------|
| App shell — Capacitor project, native plugins, www UI, scripts | **MIT** | `app/`, `scripts/` |
| `plugins/dsh-pocket` — upstream project, forked/derived | **GPL-2.0** | `plugins/dsh-pocket/LICENSE` |
| `plugins/dsh-web-mobile` — upstream project | **MIT** | `plugins/dsh-web-mobile/LICENSE` |

Any modification or redistribution of `plugins/dsh-pocket` must remain
GPL-2.0 and preserve the upstream copyright notices. DSH-Mobile does not
impose any additional restriction on those components.

